  "body": "The `/r0/account/3pid/email/requestToken` endpoint could be authenticated since the only valid use case for binding 3PIDs is to bind them to your own account. This would allow us to implement additional rate-limiting. Additionally, we could ensure that the MXID the email address is bound to and the MXID that initiated the binding process are one and the same.\r\n\r\nThis would necessitate a spec change.",
